      "description": "Starting from five elements at 20 at.% each, Cr cannot be increased while keeping all four other elemental atomic fractions constant because the total would exceed 100 at.%. The intervention must specify which elements are reduced or state that their mutual ratios, rather than their absolute fractions, remain constant."
